131	<section id="v24" class="part">
132	<h2><span class="num">Part 2</span>Version 24, the last publish</h2>
133	<p>Version 24 was published on 24 October. Its text is 41.0K, and its page 54.7K. It keeps the six parts.</p>
134	<ul>
135	<li>Part 1 is the same.</li>
136	<li>Part 2 is now 12.4K. It adds six decisions, the two numbers through batch 22, one line for each of batches 14 to 22, and a list of tokens by batch. It adds two passages of status: phase 3&rsquo;s end, and a draft batch of phase 4 that waits for your go. It cuts most of the lines on tokens.</li>
137	<li>Part 3, 2.7K, has the chart to 24 October.</li>
138	<li>Part 4, 3.6K, folds version 20&rsquo;s text into a few lines. It adds four sections on the agents&rsquo; process.</li>
139	<li>Part 5, 4.6K, has every language change through batch 22.</li>
140	<li>Part 6, 12.4K, has five more resolutions.</li>
141	</ul>
142	<p>The references gain record handles. A record handle is the number of an entry in the record, such as P-152.</p>
143	<div class="sources"><span class="label">References</span><ol class="refs">
144	<li><code>revival-story.md</code> at <code>703d005d1</code></li>
145	</ol></div>
