169	<section id="hybrid" class="part">
170	<h2><span class="num">Part 4</span>The hybrid</h2>
171	<p>The hybrid has two pages. The story is the page that she received, rebuilt. The status page is a new, short page with today&rsquo;s numbers.</p>
172	<h3>The story</h3>
173	<ul>
