70	<p class="standfirst">You asked for this on 3 November, because the closing docket, that day's list of open items, still has eight points about how you and the coordinator work. The coordinator is the Claude session that you talk to, and the record is the project's memory, the files under explorations. Times are UTC, with your time after them. The <a href="https://github.com/palimondo/fortress/blob/main/explorations/coordinator/process-engineering/timeline-2026-10-17-to-11-03.md">full note</a> has every citation.</p>
